DETI THI ZEHRA SADA &ndash; AYE MERE BEKAS HUSSAIN<br>
ZIBHA TU PYASA HUWA &ndash; AYE MERE BEKAS HUSSAIN<br>
<br>
Lutgaya sab ghar tera, Basgayi karbobala<br>
Jalgaye qaime sabhi, Chhingayi sar se rida<br>
Zulm ye kaisa huwa, Aye mere bekas Hussain<br>
<br>
Qasim-o-Akber nahi, Yawar-o-Naser nahi<br>
Aun-o-Mohammad nahi, Bezubaa&rsquo;n Asgher nahi<br>
Margaye sab aqroba, Aye mere bekas Hussain<br>
<br>
Behre madad aye khuda, Ab nahi koi raha<br>
Saqtiyaa&rsquo;n har gaam hai, Haal hai gham se bura<br>
Yaara nahi zabt ka, Aye mere bekas Hussain<br>
<br>
Ghere hain ranj-o-mehan, Baazu mein baandhi rasan<br>
Banke tamaashai hain, Raah mein sab mard-o-zan<br>
Aati hai sabko haya, Aye mere bekas Hussain<br>
<br>
Jayenge ab darbadar, Zere samaa&rsquo;n nange sar<br>
Daagh bahattar(72) ke hain, phhat-ta hai qalb-o-jigar<br>
Rote hain aal-e-aba, Aye mere bekas Hussain<br>
<br>
Zulm ka baazar hai, Abid-e-beemar hai<br>
Shaam ke darbar mein, Marhala dushwaar hai<br>
Sabr ho kaise bhala, Aye mere bekas Hussain<br>
<br>
Howegi ye daastaa&rsquo;n, kaise Sohail ab bayaa&rsquo;n<br>
Sunke gham-e-karbala, Sabke hai aansoo rawaa&rsquo;n<br>
Taari hai sab par buka, Aye mere bekas Hussain<br>

